==============================================================================
RECURSIVE INSERTION EXPOSURE S95
==============================================================================

Formula: H(T+v) = starts(sig=1) + ends(sig=0) + bridge cut Q(sig=0, sig=1)
where Q[a,b] counts old-vertex spines with only the a _ b slot left to repair.

